  "description": "Merge duplicate Functional Locations onto a master record. Find duplicates by Street 1 + Postcode, score each record by completeness + linked records + age, reallocate every linked record (Account, Work Order, Agreement, …) onto the highest-scoring master, verify, then deactivate or delete the duplicates.",
