  "published": "2026-09-07T10:10:53.187Z",
  "releaseNotes": "The interface has been rebuilt in the Fluent 2 design language so the tool looks like a modern model-driven app - light in XrmToolBox, dark in Power Platform ToolBox. This is a visual change only; how the tool finds, scores and merges duplicate Functional Locations is unchanged. It also no longer collides with other WebView2 XrmToolBox tools: the page is installed as app\\functional-location-dedup.html instead of the generic app\\index.html, so installing this tool no longer overwrites another tool's page in the shared Plugins\\app folder.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Merge duplicate Functional Locations onto a master record.",
